   "id": "hook",
   "beats": [
    {
     "id": "b00",
     "say": "You know the type, an argument starts, things get a little heated, and then..."
    },
    {
     "id": "b01",
     "say": "nothing."
    },
    {
     "id": "b02",
     "say": "One person just stops talking."
    },
    {
     "id": "b03",
     "say": "Not storming off, not slamming a door, just..."
    },
    {
     "id": "b04",
     "say": "quiet."
    },
    {
     "id": "b05",
     "say": "Arms crossed, maybe a nod here and there, but completely gone from the conversation."
    },
    {
     "id": "b06",
     "say": "And honestly, it can feel worse than yelling."
    },
    {
     "id": "b07",
     "say": "So what's actually going on there?"
    },
    {
     "id": "b08",
     "say": "Is it stubbornness?"
    },
    {
     "id": "b09",
     "say": "Is it a power move?"
    },
    {
     "id": "b10",
     "say": "Let's dig into it."
